  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peru ACA - NICFI 2021-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amazon Conservation Association aims to establish illegal deforestation monitoring systems and improve enforcement laws in Peru and Ecuador. The project will strengthen ACA&#x2019;s ongoing work in Peru, where they have provided real-time deforestation information, using satellite information in their Monitoring of the Andean Amazon Project (MAAP), for civil society and the government to engage more effectively to stop illegal deforestation at the national, regional and local level.</narrative>
  </description>
